    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that makes sense about the edge. I'll check the bevels. I've also noticed sometimes the grain seems to fight me even when I'm cutting with it, like the fibers just suddenly tear in a direction that doesn't make sense. Do you think it could be related to the moisture content in the walnut, or is there something else I should be looking at in terms of tool angle?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
