      "content": "I'll try that 15° angle on the sharpening. It’s a bit of a weird concept, though. Any other small, subtle things that could cause this? Like something about the environment or just the way the wood reacts to the tool? It almost feels like something's interfering with the cut right when I'm getting close to the end of the stroke.",
